# Frame ranges are inclusive.
# Format:
#   start-end buttons [touchX,touchY]
#
# Buttons: A, B, SELECT, START, RIGHT, LEFT, UP, DOWN, R, L, X, Y.
# Combine buttons with '+', or use NONE/NEUTRAL.
#
# This first script intentionally does nothing. It is useful for automated
# boot/hash/exit smoke tests before recording menu navigation.
0-360 NONE
